 Our joint results rest entirely on Warehouse. Bonferroni calibration reaches 0.95 joint coverage there, but a single multi-resource environment cannot support a claim that the approach generalises, and \S\ref{sec:joint} shows that guarantee is not robust to a model swap. The 86.3\% doomed-spend figure likewise does not transfer to token environments at $\delta{=}0.10$ (Table~\ref{tab:abort}).
 
